erver 判定清理工作未完成，拒绝将其从 etcd 中彻底删除。\n- **证据支撑**：证据 4 明确显示 Pod 在容器退出后长达 18 分钟仍处于 Terminating 状态，这是 finalizer 未完成清理的典型特征。\n- **未知事实**：\n  1. 注册并持有 `aiops.lab/hold` finalizer 的具体控制器组件（如 Operator 或特定的 Controller）当前状态未知。\n  2. 该控制器未能完成逻辑处理（如未发送移除请求或处理逻辑死锁）的具体原因未知。需要检查该控制器的日志及 API Server 的 Admission/Controller 日志以进一步排查。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 91.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 91.2s (Evidence 81.7s, RCA 9.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 116.574, "metrics": {"run_id": "f0d891947d7f442c", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 116.5792543888092, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评